{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"crew_outfit","model_identifier":"crew_outfit","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## crew_outfit\n\nOutfit, the artillery crewman's look on the warrior body (Patch 5).\n\nA heavy scorched leather apron from the chest to the knees, rolled linen cuffs, a cloth slouch cap, a belt with a powder pouch and the team-colour belt sash (`team_sash`, RGB 52, 96, 178). Same bones and pivots as `armour_leather` (hips, torso, arm_upper_r/l), plus `head` at the warrior's head pivot (0, 50, 0) for the cap. The rammer is `cannon_rammer`.\n\n- Cubes: 14. Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Bounds at rest: x -11..11, y 16..63, z -7..6 u."},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"leather_apron_bib#4a3322","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6,35,-5],"to":[6,47,-3.8],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[-6,35,-5],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24,0,36,12],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[48,0,49,12],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[36,0,48,12],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[49,0,50,12],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[13,55,25,56],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[25,55,37,56],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c6ef398e-d0f4-3891-f3b3-ad32fa7be52e"},{"name":"leather_strap_r#2a1d14","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[3.4,46,-5.4],"to":[5,50.4,-3.6],"autouv":0,"color":2,"origin":[3.4,46,-5.4],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[20,44,22,48],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[22,44,24,48],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[24,44,26,48],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[26,44,28,48],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[3,55,5,57],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[5,55,7,57],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"264a2b6b-8f8d-66f4-d075-d597c8b8b057"},{"name":"le